        "confidence": 0.82,
        "statement": "Our portfolio includes royalty and streaming interests in North America, South America, Africa, Asia and Australia, with key assets located in countries such as Canada, Mexico, Burkina Faso, Brazil, Namibia, Sweden, and others.",
